# Free contact-form delivery via Web3Forms (https://web3forms.com)
# 1. Go to web3forms.com, enter your email, and copy the free Access Key.
# 2. Copy this file to .env.local and paste your key below.
# 3. Messages from the contact form will be emailed to you directly.
# On Cloudflare Pages, set this as an environment variable in the dashboard.
# Without a key, the form falls back to opening the visitor's mail client.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=your-web3forms-access-key
